      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  COPY MEMBER DATEPRC - CHECK A MMDDYY DATE      A.W. 06/06/01
      *
      *  THE PROGRAM THAT COPIES THIS MUST DEFINE:
      *     WS-MDY6 PIC 9(6) REDEFINED AS WS-M6-MM, WS-M6-DD, WS-M6-YY
      *     WS-MONTH-LEN PIC 99 OCCURS 12 (DAYS PER MONTH)
      *     WS-DATE-ERR PIC X
      *  ZERO IS A VALID (EMPTY) DATE.  FEBRUARY HAS 28 DAYS.
      *  ONLY NWC600 USES THIS - NWC200 HAS ITS OWN VERSION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       9500-CHECK-MDY.
           MOVE "N" TO WS-DATE-ERR.
           IF WS-MDY6 = ZERO GO TO 9500-EXIT.
           IF WS-M6-MM < 1 OR WS-M6-MM > 12
               MOVE "Y" TO WS-DATE-ERR
               GO TO 9500-EXIT.
           IF WS-M6-DD < 1 OR WS-M6-DD > WS-MONTH-LEN(WS-M6-MM)
               MOVE "Y" TO WS-DATE-ERR.
       9500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
